   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Consider a time when you, as a child or an adult, developed a fine motor skill, such as learning to write, play an instrument, or tie your shoes. How did practice, repetition, and environmental factors like the availability of tools or guidance impact your ability to master this skill? Reflect on how this experience might relate to how infants and toddlers develop fine motor skills.",
